# Rules (id: what it flags):
#   token-literal       token-shaped literals (ghp_/gho_/ghs_, github_pat_, xoxb-/xoxp-,
#                       AKIA keys, private key headers, Slack webhook URLs, long values
#                       next to a token/key/secret/password name)
#   cmdline-secret      secrets on a command line (--token/--password literals or
#                       secret variables, curl -u user:pass, docker login -p,
#                       gh secret set --body, user:pass@ URLs, password=literal)
#   echo-secret         echo/printf/cat<<< of a *TOKEN*/*SECRET*/*PASSWORD*/*API_KEY* variable
#   set-x-secret        set -x / bash -x in a script or workflow step that also
#                       references a secret variable
#   env-dump            unfiltered env/printenv/set dump
#   baked-cloudsmith-token  delegated to scripts/lint-no-baked-tokens.sh
# Advisory (warning, exit 0):
#   missing-add-mask    workflow step derives a value from a secret with no ::add-mask::
